[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the radio compartment (1a) from the retainers (1b) and\nwithdraw it gently.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections (2a, 2b) from their housings.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Car radio</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2891020\">P20A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Car radio</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2891024\">P20B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the radio aerial coaxial cable connection from its\nhousing.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035889.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the radio aerial coaxial\ncable connection from its housing.</p><p>Fit the electrical connections in their\nhousings.</p><p>Fit the radio compartment and engage it\nin its retainers.</p>"]]